\description{
Full schedule and results of one season of one league: every round and game.

Endpoint: \verb{GET https://www.aba-liga.com/calendar/\{sez\}/\{lea\}/}
\code{sez = season - 2001}; \code{league = "aba2"} reads \verb{https://druga.aba-liga.com} with \code{lea = 2}.
